<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s303S"><span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w2">Someone</span> may respond <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w1">to this argument</span> with the following <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w3">claim</span>: The two cases are <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w4">not</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w5">same</span>. When <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w9">all this</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w10">happens</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w8">to</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w7">craving spirit</span>, it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w13">nothing more than</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w11">his own</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w12">imagination</span>. <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w15">Well then</span>, what happens <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w17">to</span> the <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w16">human</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w19">can&#x27;t be happening</span> to him <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w18">either</span>, <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w24">because</span> it&#x27;s <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w22">nothing more than</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s303w20">his</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s303w21">imagination</span>.<span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w6"><span class="nul">Continuative linkage is carried by sentence punctuation; no separate English connective.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w14"><span class="nul">Copular contribution is fused into the English contraction it’s (source spelling: it&#x27;s); no separately permitted span for its interior is.</span></span><span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s303w23"><span class="nul">Copular contribution is fused into the second English it&#x27;s; no separately permitted span for interior is.</span></span></span>
